      "content": "thanks for that. but some of my classmates are arguing that socioeconomic stuff doesn't actually explain the whole thing. they're saying that even when you look at kids from similar backgrounds, the gaps still exist, and they think it might be more about cultural values or even just different natural abilities in certain groups. do you think there's any merit to that perspective or is that just a misconception?",
